"""
NSE Stock Data Fetcher & Emailer
=================================
Fetches comprehensive yfinance data for all NSE-listed stocks,
saves to a multi-sheet Excel file, and emails it via Gmail.

SETUP:
1. pip install yfinance openpyxl pandas requests
2. Fill in CONFIG section below
3. For Gmail App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
"""

